  "title": "OppFi Announces New $150 Million Revolving Credit Facility",
  "summary": "OppFi Inc. (NYSE:OPFI) (\"OppFi\" or the \"Company\"), a tech-enabled digital finance platform that partners with banks to offer financial products and services to everyday Americans, today announced that it has closed a new $150 million revolving credit facility among one of its subsidiaries and funds managed by Castlelake L.P., replacing a prior facility. The new facility has a four-year term and represents a significant improvement in financing costs, with a reduction in the interest rate from SO",
